11.steps:
1.Add a policy into the NRPT table, and apply it to a certain user group like "DNSSEC Clients";
2.Login the DNS client as a domain user of "DNSSEC Clients", then set the DNS server as the local DNS server, which is set to forward the queries to the public server;
3.Open the command line of the DNS client, type nslookup www.yahoo.com;
4.Do steps 1-3 on different builds of 3.1.6.3s, 3.1.3.0s,3.9.1.2s,3.4.1.0e,4.2.1.0-20e and 5.6.0.0-30o.
5.Check the packets captured on DUT and local DNS server, verify that firewall forward the response which with udp payload size 4096 correctly to the client.

11.initial:
